---
// isiZulu translation of src/pages/terms.astro (issue #2).
// noindex mirrors the English page.
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { zuHref } from '../../data/i18n/zu';
---

<Base title="Imigomo Yokusebenzisa — Clinic Finder SA" description="Imigomo yokusebenzisa i-Clinic Finder SA. Imigomo yokusetshenziswa, izexwayiso, nemikhawulo yesibopho." noindex={true}>
  <div class="container" style="padding: 2rem 0 3rem;">
    <nav style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      <a href={zuHref('/')} style="color: var(--primary-dark);">Ikhasi Lokuqala</a> › Imigomo Yokusebenzisa
    </nav>

    <h1 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Imigomo Yokusebenzisa</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Igcine ukubuyekezwa: 15 May 2026</p>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--primary-dark);">Ukwamukela Imigomo</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-muted);">Ngokungena kwi-Clinic Finder SA ("isayithi"), uyavuma le migomo. Uma ungavumi, sicela ungayisebenzisi isayithi.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--primary-dark);">Inhloso Nobubanzi</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-muted);">I-Clinic Finder SA uhlu lwamahhala lwezikhungo zezempilo zomphakathi zaseNingizimu Afrika. Isayithi isiza abasebenzisi bathole imitholampilo yomphakathi, izikhungo zezempilo zomphakathi, nezibhedlela ngesifundazwe, ngensizakalo, noma ngokusondelana. Okuqukethwe kungokolwazi kuphela futhi akulona iseluleko sezokwelapha.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--primary-dark);">Akulona Iseluleko Sezokwelapha</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-muted);">Ulwazi kule sayithi, okuhlanganisa imihlahlandlela yezempilo, incazelo yezinsizakalo, nemininingwane yezikhungo, lungolwemfundo futhi aluthathi indawo yeseluleko sochwepheshe bezokwelapha, ukuhlonzwa kwesifo, noma ukwelashwa. Buza njalo umnikezi wezempilo ofanelekile ngezinkinga zezokwelapha. Esimweni esiphuthumayo sezempilo, shayela u-10177 (i-ambulensi kazwelonke) noma uye esikhungweni seziphuthumayo esiseduze nawe.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--primary-dark);">Ukunemba Kolwazi</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-muted);">Imininingwane yezikhungo ithathwe ku-OpenStreetMap nakwi-Humanitarian OpenStreetMap Team (HOTOSM), yomibili imininingwane evulekile egcinwa umphakathi. Amahora okusebenza, izinsizakalo ezinikezwayo, nemininingwane yokuxhumana kuyashintsha ngaphandle kwesaziso. Sibuyekeza amarekhodi njalo kodwa asikwazi ukuqinisekisa ukuthi yonke imininingwane iyavuselelwa. Uma uthola ulwazi oludala, sicela <a href={zuHref('/contact')} style="color: var(--primary-dark);">usazise</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--primary-dark);">Izici Zendawo</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-muted);">Isici esithi "Thola umtholampilo oseduze" sisebenzisa i-geolocation API yesiphequluli sakho. Le mininingwane icutshungulwa kwidivayisi yakho futhi ayigcinwa kumasevha ethu. Ukubalwa kwebanga kuyilinganiso futhi akufanele kuthathe indawo yesoftiwe yokuhamba lapho uya esikhungweni.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--primary-dark);">Umkhawulo Wesibopho</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-muted);">I-Clinic Finder SA inikezwa "njengoba injalo" ngaphandle kwezibambiso zanoma yiluphi uhlobo. Asinasibopho ngomonakalo ovela ekusebenziseni kwakho noma ekwethembeni kwakho ulwazi olukule sayithi, okuhlanganisa kodwa kungagcini kokungalungile kwemininingwane yezikhungo, izinsizakalo ezingatholakali, noma izinqumo zokuhamba ezisekelwe ekulinganisweni kwamabanga.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--primary-dark);">Impahla Yengqondo</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-muted);">Okuqukethwe kokuhlelwayo kokuqala, imihlahlandlela, nokuhlaziya kungokwe-Clinic Finder SA. Imininingwane yezikhungo ethathwe emarekhodini omphakathi kahulumeni akuyona impahla yethu. Ungasebenzisa okuqukethwe kwethu uma unikeza udumo.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--primary-dark);">Izinguquko Kule Migomo</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-muted);">Singayibuyekeza le migomo noma nini. Ukuqhubeka usebenzisa isayithi ngemva kwezinguquko kusho ukwamukela imigomo ebuyekeziwe.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--primary-dark);">Ukuxhumana</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-muted);">Unemibuzo ngale migomo? Thumela i-imeyili ku-<a href="mailto:hello@clinicfinder.co.za" style="color: var(--primary-dark);">hello@clinicfinder.co.za</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
